{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/currentvaluesubject"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A subject that broadcasts its current value and all subsequent values to multiple consumers.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It can also handle completion events, including normal termination and failure with an error.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncSequence"},{"text":" that allows multiple tasks to asynchronously consume values and mimics Combine’s CurrentValueSubject.","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Afluent\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Afluent\/Sci"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CurrentValueSubject","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"genericParameter"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","text":"Sendable"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Subscribing","type":"heading","anchor":"Subscribing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A consumer subscribes when its iterator is created, which is when a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"for try await"},{"type":"text","text":" loop over the subject"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(or over an operator chain built on it) begins. It first rece